silm:instances_papers_07_the_canonical_question_chapters_07_universal_property_as_answer_sections_01_mediator_uniqueness_yoneda_hom_leg_5 silm:hasExample "In 'P07UniversalPropertyAsAnswerMediatorUniquenessYonedaHomLeg5', the typed legs of the Yoneda hom-profile are witnessed by concrete Mittens-domain arrows. For example, Patient is the role Mittens occupies in VetClinic_Osei: a role-assignment arrow into D_Mittens distinguishing the role from the cat." .
